section(class="page-section page-section--editorial" id="about")

    div(class="section-inner")

        div(class="section-heading")
            p(class="section-eyebrow") About
            h2(class="section-title") Senior Unity expertise, without enterprise overhead

        div(class="about-grid")

            div

                figure(class="about-photo")
                    img(
                        src="/assets/images/global/_linked/marko-about.jpg"
                        srcset="/assets/images/global/_linked/marko-about-480.jpg 480w, /assets/images/global/_linked/marko-about.jpg 900w"
                        sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 420px, 90vw"
                        width="900"
                        height="900"
                        alt="Marko Alerić, Senior and Lead Unity Developer"
                        loading="lazy")

                div(class="availability")

                    h3 Available for Senior/Lead Unity roles and B2B engagements
                    ul
                        li Remote from Croatia / EU time zones
                        li Full-time, part-time or clearly scoped project work
                        li Short-term project rescue and overflow support
                        li Direct collaboration with founders, producers and engineering teams

            div(class="about-body")

                p.
                    I'm Marko Alerić, a Senior/Lead Unity Developer based in Croatia. I have worked
                    with Unity for over ten years and in game development since 2013, across mobile,
                    PC, console, multiplayer and live-product projects.

                p.
                    I combine hands-on engineering with technical leadership, project scoping and
                    mentoring, and I teach Unity and game programming at Algebra Bernays University.

                p.
                    Focused work is handled directly by me. When a larger scope needs additional
                    disciplines or capacity, Interactive Solutions can assemble and lead a trusted
                    team around the project — with me remaining the senior technical and client-facing lead.

                ul(class="proof-list")
                    li(class="proof-item") 10+ years working with Unity
                    li(class="proof-item") Game development since 2013/2014
                    li(class="proof-item") Senior and Lead Unity roles
                    li(class="proof-item") Multiplayer and live-product experience
                    li(class="proof-item") Published Unity Asset Store tools
                    li(class="proof-item") Founder-led delivery with scalable team support

                div(class="section-actions")
                    a(class="btn btn-secondary" href="/about/") More about Marko →
                    a(class="btn btn-ghost" href="/assets/images/global/_linked/_verbatim/CV_Marko_Aleric_EN.pdf" data-analytics="about_cv") Download CV
                    a(class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/markoaleric" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-analytics="about_linkedin") LinkedIn
                    a(class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/maleric2" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-analytics="about_github") GitHub
                    a(class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://assetstore.unity.com/publishers/40273" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-analytics="about_publisher") Asset Store